(17: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Automated%20translation%20proven%20to%20be%20quite%20resource%20intensive%2C%20we%20shoud%20update%20our%20codebase%20and%20all%20open%20pull%20requests%20in%20such%20a%20way%2C%20that%20we%20don%27t%20require%20automated%20translation%20to%20pass%2C%20we%20don%27t%20delete%20checks%20and%20tests%2C%20but%20we%20skip%20it%2C%20until%20I%20will%20decide%20we%20need%20to%20continue%20with%20automated%20translation.%0A%0AFor%20now%20we%20keep%20the%20code%2C%20tests%20and%20checks%2C%20but%20disable%20all%20failing%2C%20so%20we%20can%20iterate%20faster%20on%20other%20issues%20we%20have%20at%20the%20moment%20and%20do%20manual%20translation%20for%20now%20between%20supported%20programming%20languages.%0A%0AWe%20need%20to%20collect%20data%20related%20about%20the%20issue%20to%20this%20repository%2C%20make%20sure%20we%20compile%20that%20data%20to%20%60.%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-%7Bid%7D%60%20folder%2C%20and%20use%20it%20to%20do%20deep%20case%20study%20analysis%20%28also%20make%20sure%20to%20search%20online%20for%20additional%20facts%20and%20data%29%2C%20list%20of%20each%20and%20all%20requirements%20from%20the%20issue%2C%20and%20propose%20possible%20solutions%20and%20solution%20plans%20for%20each%20requirement%20%28we%20should%20also%20check%20known%20existing%20components%2Flibraries%2C%20that%20solve%20similar%20problem%20or%20can%20help%20in%20solutions%29.%0A%0APlease%20plan%20and%20execute%20everything%20in%20this%20single%20pull%20request%2C%20you%20have%20unlimited%20time%20and%20context%2C%20as%20context%20auto-compacts%20and%20you%20can%20continue%20indefinitely%2C%20until%20each%20and%20every%20requirement%20fully%20addressed%2C%20and%20everything%20is%20totally%20done.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
